---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service | Hogg Country" description="Terms for Hogg Country and Scout planning tools.">
  <section class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="legal-card">
        <p class="legal-eyebrow">Hogg Country</p>
        <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: May 17, 2026</p>

        <p>
          These terms apply to Hogg Country public content and Scout planning tools, including the Scout ChatGPT app. By using these tools, you agree to use them as planning aids, not as a substitute for judgment, official sources, or emergency services.
        </p>

        <h2>Planning Aid Only</h2>
        <p>
          Scout provides source leads, candidate trail context, and planning scaffolds for Appalachian Trail conversations. It does not guarantee current conditions, route safety, legal camping availability, water reliability, shuttle availability, lodging, store hours, permits, fees, or emergency response.
        </p>

        <h2>Field Responsibility</h2>
        <p>
          You are responsible for verifying live weather, closures, water, trail conditions, rules, permits, town services, transportation, and safety information before using any plan outdoors. Conditions can change quickly, and the app may contain incomplete or outdated information.
        </p>

        <h2>No Emergency Services</h2>
        <p>
          Scout cannot contact emergency responders, monitor your location, send rescue alerts, or provide medical advice. In an emergency, contact local emergency services or use your dedicated emergency communication device.
        </p>

        <h2>Read-Only ChatGPT App</h2>
        <p>
          The current Scout ChatGPT app is read-only. It does not save plans to a Scout account, modify Hogg Country content, publish content, send messages, make purchases, or push notifications to devices.
        </p>

        <h2>Content And Availability</h2>
        <p>
          Hogg Country may change, remove, or update content and tools at any time. The tools are provided as-is without warranties of accuracy, availability, fitness for a particular trip, or uninterrupted service.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For support or questions about these terms, use the public Hogg Country site at <a href="https://hoggcountry.com">https://hoggcountry.com</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .legal-page {
      padding: 3rem 0 5rem;
    }

    .legal-card {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .legal-eyebrow,
    .legal-updated {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    }

    .legal-card h1 {
      font-family: Oswald, sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
      margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
      color: var(--pine);
    }

    .legal-card h2 {
      font-family: Oswald, sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      margin: 2rem 0 0.65rem;
      color: var(--pine);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    .legal-card p {
      line-height: 1.75;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
    }

    .legal-card a {
      color: var(--pine);
      font-weight: 700;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
